## MIDI Clock

| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Resolution | 24 PPQN |
| Default BPM | 120 |
| Clock interval | 60000 / (BPM × 24) ms |
| Min interval | 5 ms |
| Max interval | 100 ms |

